  ('pci-dss','3.3.1','Requirement 3: Protect Stored Account Data','Sensitive authentication data is not retained after authorization','Sensitive authentication data (SAD) is not retained after authorization, even if encrypted. All sensitive authentication data received is rendered unrecoverable upon completion of the authorization process.','preventive','high'),
