  ('pci-dss','4.1.2','Requirement 4: Protect Cardholder Data with Strong Cryptography During Transmission Over Open, Public Networks','Roles and responsibilities for Requirement 4 are assigned','Roles and responsibilities for performing activities in Requirement 4 are documented, assigned, and understood.','governance','medium'),
  ('pci-dss','4.2.1','Requirement 4: Protect Cardholder Data with Strong Cryptography During Transmission Over Open, Public Networks','Strong cryptography safeguards PAN in transit','Strong cryptography and security protocols are implemented to safeguard PAN during transmission over open, public networks, including only accepting trusted keys and certificates and using secure protocol versions and configurations.','technical','high'),
  ('pci-dss','4.2.1.1','Requirement 4: Protect Cardholder Data with Strong Cryptography During Transmission Over Open, Public Networks','Inventory of trusted keys and certificates','An inventory of the entity''s trusted keys and certificates used to protect PAN during transmission is maintained.','technical','medium'),
