  ('pci-dss','4.2.2','Requirement 4: Protect Cardholder Data with Strong Cryptography During Transmission Over Open, Public Networks','PAN in end-user messaging is secured','PAN is secured with strong cryptography whenever it is sent via end-user messaging technologies (for example, email, instant messaging, SMS, chat).','technical','medium'),

