  ('pci-dss','5.3.3','Requirement 5: Protect All Systems and Networks from Malicious Software','Removable media is scanned for malware','For removable electronic media, the anti-malware solution(s) performs automatic scans when media is inserted, connected, or logically mounted, or performs continuous behavioral analysis of systems or processes.','detective','medium'),
  ('pci-dss','5.3.4','Requirement 5: Protect All Systems and Networks from Malicious Software','Anti-malware audit logs are retained','Audit logs for the anti-malware solution(s) are enabled and retained in accordance with Requirement 10.5.1.','detective','medium'),
  ('pci-dss','5.3.5','Requirement 5: Protect All Systems and Networks from Malicious Software','Anti-malware cannot be disabled by users','Anti-malware mechanisms cannot be disabled or altered by users, unless specifically documented and authorized by management on a case-by-case basis for a limited time period.','preventive','high'),
  ('pci-dss','5.4.1','Requirement 5: Protect All Systems and Networks from Malicious Software','Anti-phishing mechanisms protect personnel','Processes and automated mechanisms are in place to detect and protect personnel against phishing attacks.','preventive','high'),

